<x-screen-instructions :title="__('How to use Issue reports')">
    <p>{{ __('Problems Door staff reported with "Report a problem" on the Check-In Desk, newest first. Each one saves what the desk was showing at that moment (the event, the choices made, the admission decision, the price and the member\'s situation) without names, contact details, date of birth, notes or reasons. Nothing here can be edited or deleted.') }}</p>
    <p>{!! __('Open a report and use the copy button on <strong>Snapshot</strong> to share it with whoever is troubleshooting. The member appears only as a code like <code>m_3f9a…</code>, the same code for every report about the same person. An Owner can use <strong>Find this member</strong> to open that member\'s record on this installation.') !!}</p>
    <p>{{ __('The button on the desk is turned on at Feature Flags ("Report a problem from the desk").') }}</p>
</x-screen-instructions>
